1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 8=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,159
It smells wonderful.

7
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:57,519
There's a plum tree
in the garden in full bloom.

8
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,760
The fragrance is so rich,

9
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,239
so I gathered some fallen blossoms

10
00:02:01,544 --> 00:02:02,904
and brought them for you.

11
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:16,392
Tonight, the two of us...

12
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:23,759
Tonight, when we get back,
we can each take some

13
00:02:23,816 --> 00:02:25,080
and put them by our pillows.

14
00:02:25,090 --> 00:02:26,780
We're sure
to have sweet dreams all night.

15
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:38,280
Come in.

16
00:03:04,008 --> 00:03:05,432
- Young Madam.
- Young Madam.

17
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:09,599
Tomorrow is my mother's
fiftieth birthday.

18
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:12,400
All the ladies
and young women in the city

19
00:03:12,696 --> 00:03:14,840
will be going
to the Zhao Residence to celebrate.

20
00:03:15,759 --> 00:03:18,599
Zijin and Nanny Feng
will certainly be going.

21
00:03:23,719 --> 00:03:25,159
After giving it some thought,

22
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:28,439
I've chosen the three of you

23
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:30,280
to accompany me to the banquet.

24
00:03:32,936 --> 00:03:35,160
- Thank you, Young Madam.
- Thank you, Young Madam.

25
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:40,599
Once we enter the Zhao Residence,

26
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:44,759
you must follow instructions
in everything I say and do.

27
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:47,680
You are not to act on your own.

28
00:03:51,919 --> 00:03:53,960
If you think First Madam
will protect you

29
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:57,039
and disregard what I say...

30
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,599
If I could deal with Ji'er,

31
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,599
I can deal with you, too.

32
00:04:27,740 --> 00:04:29,839
(Jinling Zhao Residence.
First-Rank Scholar)

33
00:04:29,839 --> 00:04:30,759
Madam Zhao.

34
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,199
(Zhao Residence Birthday Banquet)
May your blessings be endless,

35
00:04:33,199 --> 00:04:34,420
(Women's Section)
and your life be long.

36
00:04:34,439 --> 00:04:35,879
May we all share in the joy.

37
00:04:37,759 --> 00:04:38,879
Ladies.

38
00:04:39,279 --> 00:04:40,040
Congratulations.

39
00:04:40,088 --> 00:04:41,550
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

40
00:04:41,959 --> 00:04:42,279
Come.

41
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,639
- Congratulations.
- Ladies.

42
00:04:45,288 --> 00:04:46,510
May everything go smoothly.

43
00:04:46,959 --> 00:04:48,560
Congratulations, Madam.

44
00:04:49,439 --> 00:04:51,199
Wishing you good health and a long life.

45
00:04:51,199 --> 00:04:53,439
(Longevity)

46
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:54,520
May we all share in the joy.

47
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:01,839
(Be my ears and eyes.)

48
00:05:02,879 --> 00:05:05,240
(Everything you hear
while you're with Zhao Xingtang,)

49
00:05:05,279 --> 00:05:06,439
(and everything you see,)

50
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:07,959
(report it all to me.)

51
00:05:14,140 --> 00:05:14,940
All right.

52
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,639
Xingtang.

53
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:35,079
Why didn't your husband come?

54
00:05:37,256 --> 00:05:38,712
(Zhao Xinghui, Zhao Xingtang's Cousin)
Today is

55
00:05:38,744 --> 00:05:40,312
(Young Lady of the Zhao Family's Second Branch)
Aunt's fiftieth birthday.

56
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,079
Even my husband

57
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:43,959
came with me to celebrate her birthday.

58
00:05:45,279 --> 00:05:46,560
Why did you

59
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,680
come back all by yourself?

60
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:50,959
What do you mean, all by herself?

61
00:05:51,399 --> 00:05:52,680
Don't I count?

62
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,519
Madam Wu.

63
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:57,240
Send a maid

64
00:05:57,319 --> 00:05:59,600
to bring all three young ladies
from our Lin family here.

65
00:06:00,519 --> 00:06:01,720
We wouldn't want anyone saying

66
00:06:01,759 --> 00:06:04,399
my daughter-in-law came all by herself.

67
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:13,120
If men don't go out and work hard,

68
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:15,160
how are they supposed
to rise through the ranks?

69
00:06:16,519 --> 00:06:17,759
Surely you don't think

70
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:20,240
a man can become an assistant commander

71
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:22,879
by staying home with his wife,
eating and drinking all day?

72
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,759
No wonder your husband...

73
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,279
Listen to me.

74
00:06:32,879 --> 00:06:33,800
I deserve a slap.

75
00:06:35,439 --> 00:06:36,720
Please don't take offense.

76
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:44,279
My daughter has
been pampered since childhood.

77
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:46,199
I'm sorry you've had to fuss over her.

78
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,680
With her looks and figure,

79
00:06:49,752 --> 00:06:51,120
it's not the fuss that costs me.

80
00:06:51,439 --> 00:06:52,720
It's all the fabric.

81
00:06:56,519 --> 00:06:57,439
Whenever

82
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,839
I see her,

83
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,360
I can eat an extra bowl of rice.

84
00:07:00,639 --> 00:07:02,800
Just look how much fuller I've gotten.

85
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,800
No wonder I need so much fabric.

86
00:07:07,759 --> 00:07:09,279
If you keep teasing me,

87
00:07:09,519 --> 00:07:12,279
my sisters are going to laugh at me.

88
00:07:37,279 --> 00:07:38,839
If you have something to attend to,

89
00:07:38,950 --> 00:07:40,328
there's no need to stay with us.

90
00:07:42,079 --> 00:07:42,959
It's nothing.

91
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:45,800
The servants
are making a fuss over nothing.

92
00:07:46,279 --> 00:07:48,920
They came rushing over
some trivial matter.

93
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:51,600
It would only
make everyone laugh if I told you,

94
00:07:52,079 --> 00:07:53,199
so let's not mention it.

95
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:56,000
You

96
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:58,279
need to learn from me
how to take it easy.

97
00:07:58,639 --> 00:07:59,639
I simply made up my mind

98
00:07:59,672 --> 00:08:02,632
and handed the household authority
tokens straight to my daughter-in-law.

99
00:08:02,696 --> 00:08:04,760
(Gan Yingzi, Zhao Xingtang's Sister-in-Law)
Whatever trivial matters come up,

100
00:08:04,792 --> 00:08:06,240
none of them ever reach me.

101
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,360
Easy for you to say.

102
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:11,839
You'd need a daughter-in-law
as capable as yours.

103
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,399
And you'd need to be like Madam Qin,

104
00:08:14,439 --> 00:08:16,180
knowing how to care
for your daughter-in-law

105
00:08:16,199 --> 00:08:17,480
and always standing up for her.

106
00:08:18,199 --> 00:08:19,519
That's right.

107
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:21,839
By the way,

108
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:24,639
I specially had the kitchen prepare

109
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:26,168
some nourishing soups for the winter.

110
00:08:26,510 --> 00:08:27,544
Everyone, have a taste

111
00:08:27,639 --> 00:08:29,240
and see if they're to your liking.

112
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:30,839
Go on, try some.

113
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:31,360
All right.

114
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,080
First Madam.

115
00:08:36,519 --> 00:08:37,919
My stomach doesn't feel well.

116
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:39,799
I drank too much tea just now.

117
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:40,879
I'll be right back.

118
00:08:56,679 --> 00:08:57,960
Young Madam is coming out.

119
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:58,519
Let's go.

120
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:15,399
Let's go.

121
00:09:32,344 --> 00:09:33,150
What's the matter?

122
00:09:36,424 --> 00:09:38,360
This morning, Aunt Qian
brought Young Master Qian

123
00:09:38,376 --> 00:09:39,960
to wish First Madam a happy birthday.

124
00:09:39,976 --> 00:09:42,200
The servants at the gate
didn't know what was going on

125
00:09:42,248 --> 00:09:43,816
and let them in without question.

126
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,440
First Madam couldn't
very well turn them away,

127
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,830
but she was afraid
Master would find out,

128
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:51,240
so she had Madam Li
set up a separate table for them.

129
00:09:51,288 --> 00:09:53,440
Young Master Qian
had a few drinks to drown his sorrows,

130
00:09:53,450 --> 00:09:55,780
then started crying and making a scene,
demanding to see you.

131
00:09:55,799 --> 00:09:57,870
The servants took
their eyes off him for just a moment,

132
00:09:57,880 --> 00:09:59,416
and Young Master Qian disappeared.

133
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:00,220
Madam Li was afraid

134
00:10:00,230 --> 00:10:01,960
he might wander
to the front in his confusion

135
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,200
and disturb the guests,

136
00:10:03,270 --> 00:10:05,320
so she quickly
sent more people to look for him.

137
00:10:05,330 --> 00:10:06,150
But strangely enough,

138
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:08,670
they've been searching all this time
and still haven't found him.

139
00:10:08,680 --> 00:10:10,200
Shaoze isn't that foolish.

140
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,600
He would never go
to the front and cause a scene.

141
00:10:13,799 --> 00:10:15,279
The courtyard where he used to stay?

142
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,639
And the one where I used to live?

143
00:10:17,759 --> 00:10:18,639
We've checked both.

144
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:19,679
He wasn't there.

145
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,600
Those servants are useless.

146
00:10:23,639 --> 00:10:25,440
You and Zijin split up
and search again.

147
00:10:25,559 --> 00:10:27,440
Maybe he's hiding in some little corner,

148
00:10:29,384 --> 00:10:30,750
just like when we were children

149
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:33,120
playing hide-and-seek.

150
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:35,559
If Zijin and I both leave,

151
00:10:35,639 --> 00:10:37,519
there'll be no one here
to attend to you.

152
00:10:37,848 --> 00:10:39,528
Whether it's appropriate or not,

153
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:42,279
it would draw far too much attention.

154
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,559
That Lucao

155
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:45,704
has probably run off
somewhere to shirk her duties.

156
00:10:45,710 --> 00:10:46,960
Now that we need her,

157
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:48,120
she's nowhere to be found.

158
00:10:54,639 --> 00:10:55,279
Young Madam.

159
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:56,080
Young Madam.

160
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:58,080
All right.

161
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,270
Now that they're both here,

162
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:04,000
you two hurry and go.

163
00:11:09,279 --> 00:11:10,080
- Yes.
- Yes.

164
00:12:27,279 --> 00:12:31,519
Nurture the heart
through poetry, books, and farming.

165
00:12:31,519 --> 00:12:32,559
(Zhao Residence Birthday Banquet,
Men's Section)

166
00:12:32,559 --> 00:12:36,360
Uphold family traditions,
propriety, and moral principles.

167
00:12:36,940 --> 00:12:39,940
(Fang Yu, Courtesy Name Shouyi,
Renowned Scholar of Qixia Academy)

168
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,480
I thought

169
00:12:47,592 --> 00:12:50,216
(Zhao Xuede, Zhao Xingtang's Father)
you wouldn't be able to come today.

170
00:12:50,290 --> 00:12:53,528
(Sixth-Rank Judicial Officer, Zhejiang)
I didn't expect you not only to come,

171
00:12:53,530 --> 00:12:56,520
(Provincial Administration Commission)
but also to bring Scholar Shouyi here.

172
00:12:56,536 --> 00:12:58,960
You've truly gone to great lengths.

173
00:13:00,519 --> 00:13:02,080
Today is my mother-in-law's birthday.

174
00:13:02,519 --> 00:13:03,919
How could I neglect proper courtesy?

175
00:13:05,759 --> 00:13:08,840
Scholar Shouyi is a man
of profound learning

176
00:13:08,919 --> 00:13:10,080
and great virtue and prestige.

177
00:13:10,879 --> 00:13:13,480
If we can ensure
he leaves satisfied today,

178
00:13:14,648 --> 00:13:16,240
then when Grandfather takes up the post

179
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:18,296
of chief compiler
of the Compendium of Literature,

180
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:20,279
we'll have his support.

181
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:22,799
Today,

182
00:13:23,039 --> 00:13:26,639
I will certainly not let
your thoughtful efforts go to waste.

183
00:14:05,300 --> 00:14:10,940
(Ten Thousand Volumes Library)

184
00:14:10,940 --> 00:14:14,900
(Zhao Residence Library)

185
00:14:37,672 --> 00:14:39,320
There were too many people inside.

186
00:14:39,944 --> 00:14:42,088
After being in there so long,
my head started to ache,

187
00:14:43,368 --> 00:14:44,910
so I thought I'd come out for a walk.

188
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:47,879
Before I knew it, I'd come this far.

189
00:14:49,559 --> 00:14:50,320
Lanxiang.

190
00:14:51,912 --> 00:14:53,650
The soles
of these shoes are a little thin.

191
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:55,320
My feet have gone numb.

192
00:14:56,279 --> 00:14:58,120
Go back and bring me
a pair with thicker soles.

193
00:14:59,480 --> 00:14:59,919
Yes.

194
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:17,759
Wait here.

195
00:16:49,240 --> 00:16:50,790
Excuse me, please let me through.

196
00:16:50,799 --> 00:16:51,559
I'm in a hurry...

197
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:57,000
Jiugao, you...

198
00:17:07,039 --> 00:17:07,880
Where is

199
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:09,680
Young Madam?

200
00:17:13,960 --> 00:17:14,799
The library.

201
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:29,519
If you want to stay alive,

202
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,240
don't go back.

203
00:17:47,119 --> 00:17:48,839
Xiaolian wants to live, too.

204
00:18:01,500 --> 00:18:06,900
(Zhao Gang,
Zhao Xingtang's Elder Brother)

205
00:18:13,319 --> 00:18:15,599
My father inscribed
this twenty years ago

206
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:17,960
when this garden was built.

207
00:18:21,080 --> 00:18:22,312
The sentiment is admirable,

208
00:18:23,680 --> 00:18:24,319
and so is

209
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:25,880
the calligraphy.

210
00:18:32,759 --> 00:18:34,079
Grandfather loves reading

211
00:18:35,359 --> 00:18:38,079
and always urges
the family to study hard.

212
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:40,240
There's also a library here,

213
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:41,384
with old books Grandfather

214
00:18:41,432 --> 00:18:43,480
collected from all over.

215
00:18:46,119 --> 00:18:47,599
May I have a look?

216
00:18:47,759 --> 00:18:49,839
Of course.

217
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:51,400
Scholar Shouyi,

218
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:52,119
please.

219
00:18:54,319 --> 00:18:55,079
Very well.

220
00:18:55,080 --> 00:18:55,864
I'll lead the way.

221
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:59,559
This way, please.

222
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:50,759
Shaoze.

223
00:19:52,519 --> 00:19:53,559
Shaoze.

224
00:19:58,920 --> 00:19:59,680
Xingtang.

225
00:20:00,279 --> 00:20:01,039
You...

226
00:20:02,599 --> 00:20:03,400
Shaoze.

227
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:05,544
I waited for you half the night.

228
00:20:05,592 --> 00:20:07,448
Why did it take you
so long to sneak out?

229
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:11,160
Fool.

230
00:20:12,440 --> 00:20:14,599
That was so many years ago.

231
00:20:16,039 --> 00:20:16,920
We...

232
00:20:18,880 --> 00:20:20,720
haven't been here in almost seven years.

233
00:20:37,400 --> 00:20:39,000
You married into the Lin family,

234
00:20:40,024 --> 00:20:41,880
and I was driven out
of the Zhao Residence.

235
00:20:44,599 --> 00:20:45,400
The child...

236
00:20:47,279 --> 00:20:48,359
Our child...

237
00:20:50,079 --> 00:20:51,119
It was all my fault.

238
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:52,920
It was all my fault.

239
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:54,839
I couldn't marry you properly,

240
00:20:55,119 --> 00:20:56,640
so you lost our child

241
00:20:56,650 --> 00:20:57,830
and your health suffered, too!

242
00:20:57,839 --> 00:20:58,440
Shaoze!

243
00:21:04,856 --> 00:21:05,790
It wasn't your fault.

244
00:21:06,599 --> 00:21:07,759
It really wasn't.

245
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:10,720
It's this world we live in.

246
00:21:12,920 --> 00:21:13,799
It's in the past.

247
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:16,319
It's all in the past.

248
00:21:20,039 --> 00:21:21,319
I heard

249
00:21:22,056 --> 00:21:24,088
that you and Lin Jinqi
have fallen for each other.

250
00:21:24,519 --> 00:21:26,599
To please you,

251
00:21:27,280 --> 00:21:29,070
Lin Jinqi went
all the way to Qixia Academy

252
00:21:29,110 --> 00:21:31,464
to invite Fang Shouyi
to Aunt's birthday celebration.

253
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:32,640
Is that true?

254
00:21:32,960 --> 00:21:33,680
Is it?

255
00:21:36,776 --> 00:21:38,904
No wonder you came
to the birthday celebration.

256
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:40,440
Where did you

257
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:42,000
hear such nonsense?

258
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:43,799
Why would Fang Shouyi

259
00:21:43,799 --> 00:21:45,640
come to celebrate my mother's birthday?

260
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:48,519
And why would
Lin Jinqi try to please me?

261
00:21:49,039 --> 00:21:51,039
He's trying to please Grandfather.

262
00:21:52,920 --> 00:21:53,680
Xingtang.

263
00:21:55,960 --> 00:21:57,279
You can't abandon me.

264
00:21:58,279 --> 00:21:59,440
You can't abandon me.

265
00:22:02,079 --> 00:22:04,680
Shaoze, this isn't the time.

266
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:05,519
Shaoze.

267
00:22:05,519 --> 00:22:06,759
I can't lose you.

268
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:07,559
Xingtang.

269
00:22:07,799 --> 00:22:08,880
I can't lose you.

